cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "FedMAQ experiments: a federated-learning testbed with matched-budget byte accounting"
abstract: >-
  Code, frozen configuration, and run machinery for evaluating memory-bounded
  adaptive quantization and ensemble distillation (FedMAQ) against FedAvg,
  FedPAQ, DAdaQuant, FedKD and other baselines in simulated federated learning
  on CIFAR-10, CIFAR-100, and FEMNIST, with shared byte accounting across
  methods.
authors:
